%% HakiArdhi - AI Message Routing
%% This shows how the AI chatbot processes and routes incoming messages

graph TD
    Start([Incoming WhatsApp Message]) --> A{First message<br/>from user?}

    A -->|Yes| B[Send Welcome Message<br/>+ Main Menu]
    A -->|No| C[Load conversation history<br/>last 10 messages]

    B --> C

    C --> D[AI PROCESSES MESSAGE<br/>OpenAI GPT-4]

    D --> E[INTENT CLASSIFICATION]

    E --> F{Identified Intent}

    F -->|Greeting| G1[Send friendly<br/>welcome response]
    F -->|Legal Aid| G2[Start Legal Aid<br/>request flow]
    F -->|Incident Report| G3[Start Incident<br/>reporting flow]
    F -->|Case Status| G4[Check case<br/>status inquiry]
    F -->|Project Info| G5[Send project<br/>information]
    F -->|General Question| G6[AI generates<br/>answer]
    F -->|Unclear| G7[Escalate to<br/>human agent]

    G1 --> H[ESCALATION CHECK]
    G2 --> H
    G3 --> H
    G4 --> H
    G5 --> H
    G6 --> H
    G7 --> I[ROUTE TO HUMAN AGENT]

    H --> J{Should<br/>escalate?}

    J -->|Yes| K[ROUTE TO SERVICE]
    J -->|No| L[AI GENERATES RESPONSE]

    K --> M{Service Type}
    M -->|Legal Aid| N1[Send interactive buttons:<br/>Case Type Selection]
    M -->|Incident Report| N2[Send interactive buttons:<br/>Incident Type Selection]
    M -->|Human Agent| N3[Notify staff member:<br/>Citizen needs assistance]

    L --> O[Generate contextual response:<br/>• Bilingual English/Swahili<br/>• Context-aware<br/>• Helpful and clear]

    O --> P[Generate 3 Smart Replies<br/>Quick response options]

    N1 --> Q[SEND TO USER via WhatsApp]
    N2 --> Q
    N3 --> Q
    P --> Q
    I --> Q

    Q --> R[Log conversation to database:<br/>• Message content<br/>• Intent classified<br/>• Response sent<br/>• Timestamp]

    R --> End([Await Next Message])

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style D fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff
    style E fill:#FF9800,stroke:#E65100,color:#fff
    style K fill:#9C27B0,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#fff
    style L fill:#00BCD4,stroke:#0097A7,color:#fff
    style Q fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style End fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
